- Provide a brief rationale explaining your rating based on the criteria above.
- End your response with a final line containing ONLY the score in this exact format: Score: <1, 2, or 3>
- Do not output any other text after the score line. Do not output scores outside this scale. Ensure strict compliance with the format.
