- 3 (High Engagingness): The response actively builds conversational momentum. It offers a compelling opinion, asks a thought-provoking or playful follow-up, shares vivid details, or demonstrates genuine curiosity. It naturally draws the partner into continuing the exchange with enthusiasm.

